---
// Organism: HowItWorks Section
// "Tu control" section with agenda details
---

<section class="landing-section-compact bg-bg-primary" id="como-funciona">
  <div class="landing-container grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
    <div>
      <div class="landing-eyebrow border border-border bg-white/5 text-text-primary mb-6">Tu control</div>
      <h2 class="landing-title font-headline font-bold text-text-primary mb-6">Sabé qué sigue, <br/>sin estrés</h2>
      <p class="landing-lead text-text-secondary mb-10">Nuestra vista de agenda te relaja. Olvidate de las notificaciones constantes y concentrate en pulir lo que mejor hacés.</p>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 glass-panel rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-primary/20 shadow-md">
          <i class="ri-shield-check-fill text-primary text-2xl"></i>
          <div>
            <p class="font-headline font-bold text-text-primary text-base">Protección de ingresos</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-text-primary mt-1">Cobro de seña online. Reducimos el ausentismo.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 rounded-xl border border-border bg-bg-primary">
          <i class="ri-refresh-line text-primary-light text-2xl"></i>
          <div>
            <p class="font-headline font-bold text-text-primary text-base">Sincronización Total</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-text-primary mt-1">Conectamos con calendarios externos para organizar tu vida.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="relative group" aria-label="Vista destacada de agenda Orvel">
      <div class="absolute -inset-6 bg-primary-light/10 blur-[60px] rounded-[3rem] opacity-60 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity"></div>
      <div class="relative z-10 overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] border border-border bg-gradient-to-br from-white/10 via-primary/10 to-bg-primary p-3 shadow-2xl transform rotate-1 group-hover:rotate-0 transition-transform duration-500">
        <div class="mb-3 flex items-center justify-between rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-bg-primary/80 px-4 py-3 backdrop-blur">
          <div>
            <p class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary-light">Agenda Orvel</p>
            <p class="text-sm font-headline font-bold text-text-primary">Tu día claro de un vistazo</p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-full border border-primary/30 bg-primary/10 px-3 py-1 text-[11px] font-bold text-primary-light">Controlado</div>
        </div>
        <img
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
          alt="Vista de agenda Orvel con turnos confirmados y resumen del día"
          class="w-full rounded-2xl border border-white/10 object-cover shadow-xl"
          src="/banner2.png"
        />
      </div>
      <div class="absolute -bottom-5 left-6 z-20 hidden rounded-2xl border border-primary/20 bg-bg-primary/90 px-4 py-3 shadow-xl backdrop-blur sm:block">
        <p class="text-xs font-bold text-text-primary">Próximo turno confirmado</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-[11px] text-text-primary/75">Menos dudas, más foco en tu salón</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
